          ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{c}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,d=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "If ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}0 &=4 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=5 \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe first equation is a false statement. Hence,the system has no solution."
