          ":question/id": "4ccf091c-7121-5c91-b86a-266cd19f2350",
          ":question/math-academy-id": "q-73957",
          ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{1} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=-10 \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=8 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second equation by $2$ and adding that resiult to the first equation,  we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2}-4{x}_{2} & =-10+16 \\\\ -3{x}_{2} & =6 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow,  we substitute ${x}_{2}=-2$ into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} & =8 \\\\ {x}_{1}-2(-2) & =8 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =8-4 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=4$ and ${x}_{2}=-2$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} & =-2 \\\\ -2(4)-3(-2) & =-2 \\\\ -8+6 & =-2,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=4$ and ${x}_{2}=-2,$ which means\n\n$$\n4{a}_{1}-2{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=4-2=2.\n$$"
        }
